oad, around 1h 33m of it driving."}],"introHeading":"A route with direction,\nnever a rigid schedule.","introCopy":"Every stay, transfer and encounter is handled. The rhythm remains spacious, and every detail can be changed around your interests.","includedHeading":"Private by design.\nSupported throughout.","includedCopy":"Handpicked accommodation, daily breakfast, private transport, specialist hosts, selected experiences and 24/7 local assistance are included. International flights and travel insurance are excluded."},{"slug":"cultural-triangle-short","title":"The Cultural Triangle","days":"3 days","durationDays":3,"route":"CMB airport → Dambulla → Sigiriya → Polonnaruwa","price":"From $520","image":"/images/destination/polonnaruwa-ancient-city.jpg","note":"Three days among rock temples, ruined capitals and the elephants of Minneriya.","stops":["dambulla-cave-temple","sigiriya-rock-fortress","minneriya-national-park","polonnaruwa-ancient-city"],"imageAlt":"The Cultural Triangle","itinerary":[{"period":"Day 1","title":"Dambulla Cave Temple · Sigiriya Rock Fortress","copy":"19 km on the road, around 29m of it driving."},{"period":"Day 2","title":"Minneriya National Park · Polonnaruwa Ancient City","copy":"39 km on the road, around 1h 1m of it driving."}],"introHeading":"A route with direction,\nnever a rigid schedule.","introCopy":"Every stay, transfer and encounter is handled. The rhythm remains spacious, and every detail can be changed around your interests.","includedHeading":"Private by design.\nSupported throughout.","includedCopy":"Handpicked accommodation, daily breakfast, private transport, specialist hosts, selected experiences and 24/7 local assistance are included. International flights and travel insurance are excluded."},{"slug":"hill-country-short","title":"Into the Hill Country","days":"3 days","durationDays":3,"route":"Kandy → Nuwara Eliya → Ella","price":"From $480","image":"/images/destination/nine-arches-bridge-viewpoint.jpg","note":"The blue trai